AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_41423> "A member of the class of pyrazoles that is 1<em>H</em>-pyrazole which is substituted at positions 1, 3 and 5 by 4-sulfamoylphenyl, trifluoromethyl and <em>p</em>-tolyl groups, respectively. A cyclooxygenase-2 inhibitor, it is used in the treatment of arthritis.")
