# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_7581> (nitrazepam)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_7581> "A 1,4-benzodiazepinone that is 1,3-dihydro-2<em>H</em>-1,4-benzodiazepin-2-one which is substituted at positions 5 and 7 by phenyl and nitro groups, respectively. It is used as a hypnotic for the short-term management of insomnia and for the treatment of epileptic spasms in infants (West's syndrome).")
