SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_78433> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_33232>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_7852> (oxycodone)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_7852> "A semisynthetic opioid of formula C<small><sub>18</sub></small>H<small><sub>21</sub></small>NO<small><sub>4</sub></small> that is derived from thebaine.  It is a moderately potent opioid analgesic, generally used for relief of moderate to severe pain.")
